  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "Small",
      "text": "ISSUE 01 / 16 SEPTEMBER 2026 / FIRST READ"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "RESEARCH DIGEST"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "Atlas invitations: agree the next learning step."
    },
    {
      "style": "Small",
      "text": "For product, design and research partners • Fictional training example"
    },
    {
      "style": "RecordBody",
      "text": "New to this digest: the 15 September study and its proposed follow-up. No decision has been accepted."
    },
    {
      "style": "PressLabel",
      "text": "01 / NEW EVIDENCE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Members was the first stop"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Observation. Six of eight first-time admins looked in Members for invitations. Four of the eight needed…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PressLink",
      "text": "Read SYN-S01 and E01–E08 →"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "A location mismatch is plausible"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Interpretation F01. The invitation control may conflict with some first-time admins’ expectations. Two…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PressLink",
      "text": "Open finding F01 →"
    },
    {
      "style": "Small",
      "text": "Scope: eight fictional English-language desktop sessions. Mobile, assistive technology, task time and…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PressLabel",
      "text": "02 / DECISION & FOLLOW-THROUGH"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "D01 remains proposed"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Request a focused test of a Members invitation entry point against a feasible alternative. Agree…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PressLink",
      "text": "Open the D01 decision record →"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "No implementation claim"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Delivery C01 is not started in this digest scenario. Preserving the existing confirmation is a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PressLink",
      "text": "Open the delivery record →"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What needs an answer"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Owner acceptance is unknown. Product, design and research roles are suggested, not assigned. Revisit…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Small",
      "text": "Next check: compare unassisted discovery and capture expectations. Keep assistance distinct from…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "THE RECORD BEHIND THE UPDATE"
    },
    {
      "style": "RecordBody",
      "text": "Fictional evidence and workflow records. IDs link the digest to the shared Atlas fixture; later events…"
    },
    {
      "style": "RecordHeading",
      "text": "SYN-S01 / Study and sources"
    },
    {
      "style": "RecordBody",
      "text": "15 Sep 2026. Moderated invitation task in desktop prototype v0.1; eight purposively selected first-time…"
    },
    {
      "style": "RecordHeading",
      "text": "E01–E08 / Observed first location and assistance"
    },
    {
      "style": "Small",
      "text": "Six Members-first; four hints overall. A hint is assistance, not independent success. The fixture…"
    },
    {
      "style": "RecordHeading",
      "text": "F01 / Interpretation and counterevidence"
    },
    {
      "style": "RecordBody",
      "text": "Members-first records: E01, E02, E03, E05, E06, E08. Settings-first counterevidence: E04, E07. Possible…"
    },
    {
      "style": "RecordHeading",
      "text": "D01 / Proposed → proposed"
    },
    {
      "style": "RecordBody",
      "text": "Request: test a Members entry point. Owner acceptance: false in the source; no person assigned. Review:…"
    },
    {
      "style": "RecordHeading",
      "text": "C01 / Delivery is not an outcome"
    },
    {
      "style": "RecordBody",
      "text": "Scenario status: not started. D03 proposes retaining confirmation; no implementation evidence exists.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "PressLink",
      "text": "← Return to the digest"
    }
  ],
